+  "content": "The equation $2^{x+2} 5^{6-x}=10^{x^{2}}$ has two real solutions. Determine these two solutions.\n\nSolve step by step. If there are multiple solutions, give them all as a comma-separated list inside a single \\boxed{}."
+ },
+ {
